  BorderColor #2F6DB5
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #2F6DB5
}
title Report artifact status (reports.artifact_status)
[*] --> DRAFT : create()\ndefault artifactStatus
DRAFT -left-> REVIEWING : markArtifactReviewing()\non review request
REVIEWING -right-> DRAFT : releaseArtifactReviewing()\nno active or completed review
DRAFT -right-> FINAL : updateArtifactStatus()\nneeds 1 completed review
FINAL -left-> DRAFT : updateArtifactStatus()\nwhile no active review
DRAFT -down-> ARCHIVED : updateArtifactStatus()
FINAL -down-> ARCHIVED : updateArtifactStatus()
ARCHIVED -up-> DRAFT : updateArtifactStatus()
note bottom of REVIEWING
  Set by review-request.service only.
  While review requests are active, updateArtifactStatus()
  allows only REVIEWING (artifactStatusChangeError).
end note
@enduml
